    title: "trading psychology",
    subtitle: "The behavioural side of trading. Position sizing math, the bull-market mistakes that repeat, journaling as a forcing function, and how to run a losing-week post-mortem.",
    entries: [
      { slug: "four-mistakes-every-bull-market-since-2017" },
